  "description": "Kafka testing utilities for XUnitAssured using Confluent.Kafka. Provides KafkaTestFixture, settings, authentication handlers (SASL, SSL), and helpers for integration testing with Apache Kafka. v3.0: Aligned with framework architecture refactoring. v5.0: Added .NET 10 support.",
